0,Luba-Kasai language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luba-Kasai_language,"Luba-Kasai, also known as Cilubà or Tshilubà, [4] Luba-Lulua, [5][6] is a Bantu language (Zone L) of Central Africa and a national language of the Democratic Republic of the Congo, alongside Lingala, Swahili, and Kikongo ya leta.",Luba-Kasai,Niger-Congo
