8,"Songs from the Luba, Kaonde, and Lunda people of Zambia and the ...",https://folkways.si.edu/songs-from-the-luba-kaonde-and-lunda-people-of-zambia-and-the-democratic-republic-of-congo/world/music/album/smithsonian,"In 1957, Hugh Tracey recorded several groups of Luba people in the Eastern Kasai of the Democratic Republic of Congo as well as in various mining compounds in Zambia.",Luba-Kasai,Niger-Congo
